# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Fan-Shun Meng et al. (2025). Formation of three-dimensional dislocation networks in α -iron twist grain boundaries: Insights from first-principles neural network interatomic potentials.
#   Computational Materials Science. doi:10.1016/j.commatsci.2025.113812
#
# Version read: submittedVersion (sha256 ab9b2983a3fd2c35...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 604 (Application/model instance). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/meng2025formation.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the alpha-Fe-H neural-network potential of Ref. 27
# (NNIP-0, an atom-centred-symmetry-function HDNNP) as used for twist
# grain boundaries, and the ensemble of 12 NNIPs retrained on the same
# database for uncertainty estimation. Their errors are stated only as
# ranges, and the ten literature alpha-Fe MLIPs are compared on properties
# in the SI, so there are no results.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix mls: <http://www.w3.org/ns/mls#> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix mlips: <https://w3id.org/mlips#> .
@prefix entity: <https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/> .

###############################################################################
# Q1 -- Bibliographic identification
###############################################################################

entity:study-meng2025formation a mlips:BenchmarkStudy ;
    rdfs:label "Meng et al. (2025): 3D dislocation networks in alpha-iron twist grain boundaries from a neural-network potential" ;
    mlips:reportedIn entity:article-meng2025formation .

entity:article-meng2025formation a schema:ScholarlyArticle ;
    schema:sameAs <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.commatsci.2025.113812> ;
    schema:datePublished "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    schema:name "Formation of three-dimensional dislocation networks in α -iron twist grain boundaries: Insights from first-principles neural network interatomic potentials" ;
    schema:author <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2009-1558> ,
        entity:person-Li-meng2025formation ,
        <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0471-3991> ,
