###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Ensemble errors are given only as ranges over the 12 NNIPs (energy RMSE 3.47-5.43 meV/atom train and 3.46-10.33 test; force RMSE 0.077-0.083 eV/A train and 0.077-0.145 test, Sec. 3.4); per-model values are in SI Table S2, which was not read. Ranges are not encoded.
# - NNIP-0's own errors are reported in Ref. 27 (meng2021, needs-pdf), not here. The ensemble force uncertainty ('about 10 meV/A') is approximate.
# - Grain-boundary energies, lattice and defect properties of ten literature alpha-Fe MLIPs (GAP, ANN, MTPs, QNML, ADP-ML, DPs; SI Table S1), EAM and MEAM are property comparisons and are not encoded.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/meng2025formation.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.
